https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/milestones/38/labels","id":223478,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lMjIzNDc4","number":38,"title":"4.0.0.Beta1","description":"","creator":{"login":"normanmaurer","id":439362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM2Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/439362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer","html_url":"https://github.com/normanmaurer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":150,"state":"closed","created_at":"2012-12-04T08:11:26Z","updated_at":"2013-09-05T14:18:37Z","due_on":"2013-02-14T08:00:00Z","closed_at":"2013-04-13T09:29:12Z"},"comments":10,"created_at":"2012-09-30T06:59:25Z","updated_at":"2012-12-19T05:57:02Z","closed_at":"2012-12-19T05:57:02Z","author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Since com.sun.nio.sctp.SctpChannel is a InterruptibleChannel, OioEventLoop's thread.interrupt() usage (to switch read/write in single threaded event loop) closes the channel prematurely. \n\njava.nio.channels.ClosedByInterruptException\njava.nio.channels.ClosedByInterruptException\n    at java.nio.channels.spi.AbstractInterruptibleChannel.end(AbstractInterruptibleChannel.java:202)\n    at sun.nio.ch.SctpChannelImpl.receive(SctpChannelImpl.java:772)\n    at sun.nio.ch.SctpChannelImpl.receive(SctpChannelImpl.java:730)\n    at io.netty.channel.socket.oio.OioSctpChannel.doReadMessages(OioSctpChannel.java:117)\n    at io.netty.channel.socket.oio.AbstractOioMessageChannel$OioMessageUnsafe.read(AbstractOioMessageChannel.java:45)\n    at io.netty.channel.socket.oio.OioEventLoop.run(OioEventLoop.java:81)\n    at io.netty.channel.SingleThreadEventExecutor$1.run(SingleThreadEventExecutor.java:80)\n    at java.lang.Thread.run(Thread.java:722)\n\nSo I did following change in OioEventLoop to get it working. This change was merged into the master  without review (https://github.com/netty/netty/pull/619) :-) .\n\nOioEventLoop: before OioSctpChannel\n\n```\nprotected void wakeup(boolean inEventLoop) {\n    interruptThread();\n}\n```\n\nOioEventLoop:  change after OioSctpChannel pull request\n\n```\nprotected void wakeup(boolean inEventLoop) {\n    if (!inEventLoop && isShutdown()) {\n        interruptThread();\n    }\n}\n```\n\nNow problem is,  OioSctpChannel's write() does not work properly sometime because, the event loop thread is blocked on ch.unsafe().read(); foreever without processing task queue.\n\nCan we come up with a separate EventLoop for  blocking InterruptibleChannels or is there any other way to solve this issue?\n\nPlease note that, I could not reproduce this issue with OioSocketChannel or even in OioSctpEchoClient/Server :) \n","closed_by":{"login":"normanmaurer","id":439362,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzOTM2Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/439362?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer","html_url":"https://github.com/normanmaurer","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/normanmaurer/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/632/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/netty/netty/issues/632/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}